exports[`/pricing with monthly prices only > renders the pinned page 1`] = `"<div class="min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground"><header class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-5 md:px-6"><a class="flex items-center gap-2.5" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-700 text-xs font-bold text-white">VS</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-foreground">Vibe Socials</span></a><nav aria-label="Main" class="flex items-center gap-1"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--radius)] font-medium transition-colors select-none outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 text-foreground hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-8 px-3 text-sm" href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--radius)] font-medium transition-colors select-none outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 text-foreground hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-8 px-3 text-sm" href="/about">About</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--radius)] font-medium transition-colors select-none outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 text-foreground hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-8 px-3 text-sm" href="/login">Log in</a></nav></header><main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-4 pb-16 pt-6 md:px-6"><h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">Pricing</h1><p class="mt-4 text-base text-foreground">14<!-- -->-day free trial. No card needed to start.</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Each plan covers one workspace: one business with its own connected accounts. A second workspace needs its own plan once your trial ends.</p><div class="mt-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><p class="font-medium text-foreground">Every plan includes:</p><ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5"><li>Google Business Profile posts with buttons, offers and events.</li><li>AI drafts of replies to your Google reviews.</li><li>Links your clients use to send photos, approve posts and connect their accounts, without an account of their own.</li><li>A monthly report with the calls, direction requests and website clicks from your Google listing.</li></ul></div><ul class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Starter</h2><p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">$19 a month</p><ul class="mt-4 flex-1 space-y-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Up to 3 posts a day (about 90 a month)</li><li>Up to 15 posts to X a month</li><li>Up to 1 YouTube upload a day</li><li>2 GB of photos and videos</li></ul><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--radius)] font-medium transition-colors select-none outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 text-sm mt-5 w-full" href="/register">Start your free trial</a></li><li class="flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Growth</h2><p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">$39 a month</p><ul class="mt-4 flex-1 space-y-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Up to 6 posts a day (about 180 a month)</li><li>Up to 40 posts to X a month</li><li>Up to 3 YouTube uploads a day</li><li>5 GB of photos and videos</li></ul><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--radius)] font-medium transition-colors select-none outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 text-sm mt-5 w-full" href="/register">Start your free trial</a></li><li class="flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 text-card-foreground"><h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Pro</h2><p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">$79 a month</p><ul class="mt-4 flex-1 space-y-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Up to 15 posts a day (about 450 a month)</li><li>Up to 100 posts to X a month</li><li>Up to 5 YouTube uploads a day</li><li>15 GB of photos and videos</li></ul><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-[var(--radius)] font-medium transition-colors select-none outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-xs hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 text-sm mt-5 w-full" href="/register">Start your free trial</a></li></ul><div class="mt-6 space-y-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><p><a class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-foreground" href="/terms">Read the Terms of Service</a></p></div><section aria-labelledby="faq-heading" class="mt-10"><h2 id="faq-heading" class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Questions</h2><dl class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-sm"><div><dt class="font-medium text-foreground">What is a workspace?</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">A workspace is one business: its connected accounts, posts, media and team.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-medium text-foreground">What happens when the trial ends?</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">Posting stops until you choose a plan. A scheduled post that comes due while there is no plan is marked failed, and you can retry it from Activity once you have chosen a plan, as long as its photos and videos are still kept. Photos and videos of finished posts (published, failed or cancelled) are removed 30 days after they were last added to a post.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-medium text-foreground">How do I cancel?</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">Cancel any time in Settings, under Plan. The <a class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-foreground" href="/terms">Terms</a> say what happens to the time you have already paid for. When the plan ends, the workspace works as after a trial.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-medium text-foreground">Do you give refunds?</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">We do not refund a period that has already started, except where the law requires it.</dd></div><div><dt class="font-medium text-foreground">Who do I write to?</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">Write to<!-- --> <a href="mailto:info@vibesurfschool.com" class="underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-foreground">info@vibesurfschool.com</a>.</dd></div></dl></section></main><footer class="border-t border-border"><div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground sm:flex-row md:px-6"><span>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Vibe Socials<!-- --> · operated by <!-- -->Vibe Surf School LLC</span><nav aria-label="Legal" class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1"><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/about">About</a><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/about#contact">Contact</a><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/terms">Terms</a><a class="hover:text-foreground" href="/data-deletion">Delete your data</a></nav></div></footer></div>"`;
